  m_text: "\tConsent to Participate\n\nYou are invited to take part in a virtual
    Stroop attention experiment.\n\nYou will identify the ink color of words while
    smartphone notifications may appear or sound.\n\nYour responses, accuracy and
    reaction times will be recorded for this demonstration.\n\nParticipation is voluntary.
    You may stop or reset the experiment at any time.\n\nBy selecting \"I Consent\",
    you agree to participate in this simulated experiment."
